      "message": "Please add a comment before reserved indicating how it is being used. Please do the same in include/uapi/linux/videodev2.h on the \"reserved\" field declaration for v4l2_plane. This will cause a conflict if the reserved field is used by upstream -- better to catch it at merge time than have it silently fail.",
