      "side": 1,
      "message": "yes Todd sizeof(p32-\u003ereserved) \u003d\u003d sizeof(p64-\u003ereserved) is same always as reserved is __u32 type.\n\nalso upstream code is using p64-\u003edata_offset instead of p32-\u003edata_offset where data_offset is __u32 type.\n\nbut anyway I think it is good to use p32-\u003ereserved here so I will modify it.",
